 (山羊の白カビ、これも単独で食べます)","ts":"1632721309.279200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"cheese_wedge","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ijI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9768870a-e6ff-4b17-b411-edf08d07443a","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"meadはニッチですねｗ\n紹興酒あたりも追加したい感。絵文字で表せるかはびみょいですが","ts":"1632719371.278300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"u6709","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0jZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1452e9aa-24ec-4683-9b6c-637fab1dfaee","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":mead: ほしくなりますね","ts":"1632719036.277000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SGuO0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e7df473-f242-4f5b-ad82-f0b8cadf195c","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですね (厳密にいうと日本酒だけちょっと別枠)","ts":"1632718985.276600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i4g"}]},{"client_msg_id":"50a9b066-fb1e-4d6f-a003-f4ffaf637d49","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"それも全部醸造酒だｗ","ts":"1632718935.276100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fukaikousatsu","count":2,"users":["U03C4RC8X","UGHD6GP16"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kXF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa05af39-a442-4ca2-8a42-628adcee2828","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"お酒のスタンプが押されているｗ","ts":"1632718688.274800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"fukaikousatsu","count":3,"users":["U03C4RC8X","UD1FQV38V","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JdZi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f0959117-73c1-420d-bd58-8d25d44cb1f2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"経験的には植物で腐り気味の食べても、